"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this license.

"Hosted Service" means any deployment of the Software, or any software
substantially derived from the Software, that is made accessible to third
parties over a network — whether publicly, privately, behind authentication,
via API, embedded in another product, or by any other means — regardless of
whether a fee is charged.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software, in original or modified form,
that is intended to generate revenue, monetary compensation, non-monetary
compensation, credit, or any other form of value for You or any third party,
directly or indirectly.

"Rate-Limiting Mechanism" means any logic, configuration, infrastructure, or
enforcement system — including but not limited to search quotas, credit systems,
request throttling, API gateway rules, or account tiers — that restricts the
volume or frequency of searches or API calls made through the Software.

"Circumvention" means any act that bypasses, disables, modifies, removes,
replaces, or renders ineffective any Rate-Limiting Mechanism, whether in the
original Software or in any derivative version, including but not limited to:
creating multiple accounts, rotating credentials, forking the Software to remove
limits, deploying modified versions without equivalent limits, or using automated
means to exceed enforced thresholds.

